.23424, 141.16721] -- E3 does not rate hippocampal proposals higher than random\n", "claim_ids": ["MECH-022"], "evidence_direction": "non_contributory", "experiment_type": "v3_exq_190a_mech022_hypothesis_injection_probe_wellpowered", "experiment_purpose": "evidence", "fatal_error_count": 0, "supersedes": "v3_exq_190_mech022_hypothesis_injection_probe", "arm_results": [{"seed": 42, "condition": "INJECTION_ON", "injection_enabled": true, "harm_rate": 0.04359599241808827, "harm_events": 161, "mean_residue": 39.16763701698434, "mean_traj_score": 118.7690614167519, "novel_cell_visits": 62, "mean_score_var": 0.2408343327812411, "total_steps": 3693, "arm_fingerprint": {"schema": "arm_fp/v1", "arm_fingerprint": "6875f6ef409c7cfdf0231eb2a0f00a6ef71d2eb3c443ada254d6ea140fdd8a26", "substrate_hash": "67f66db036412537152082154064028ce63dd561e0235514bfd79ffddbf227f9", "substrate_n_files": 182, "machine_class": "linux-x86_64-py3.10-torch2.12.0+cpu", "torch_version": "2.12.0+cpu", "regime": "A", "seed": 42, "config_slice_declared": true, "substrate_scope_declared": false, "substrate_scope": null, "reuse_eligible": true, "reuse_ineligible_reasons": [], "driver_script_in_substrate_hash": false, "driver_script_hash": "98a0dfc149fb06719a97c108eaa81169d2e026b02f8b57612a1e8b63166f55ab", "substrate_identity_source": "process_snapshot", "substrate_identity_resolved_at": "2026-08-08T22:54:36Z"}}, {"seed": 42, "condition": "INJECTION_OFF", "injection_enabled": false, "harm_rate": 0.046120286693674045, "harm_events": 148, "mean_residue": 38.458843564051044, "mean_traj_score": 125.41597192109316, "novel_cell_visits": 64, "mean_score_var": 14.691001597815657, "total_steps": 3209, "arm_fingerprint": {"schema": "arm_fp/v1", "arm_fingerprint": "ffcedc8d89feb90edea09142b585b8387f06656e673faddeae20bf343ed9553c", "substrate_hash": "67f66db036412537152082154064028ce63dd561e0235514bfd79ffddbf227f9", "substrate_n_files": 182, "machine_class": "linux-x86_64-py3.10-torch2.12.0+cpu", "torch_version": "2.12